  "instance_name": "reductionist_meme_format",
  "label": "Reductionist Meme Format",
  "description": "The meme format — using a historical image with bold, declarative text — is a reductionist approach that oversimplifies a profound historical injustice. This format can be harmful because it frames historical trauma as a 'how-to' or 'shocking revelation,' which may trivialize the suffering of enslaved people and reduce their experiences to a visual punchline. This format is often used to provoke shock or outrage without providing context or nuance, which can be reductive and potentially offensive.",
